  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Private Sector Development Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Private Sector Development Program (PSDP) promotes inclusive, sustainable, and climate-resilient economic growth by engaging the private sector, strengthening regional business linkages, improving business support services, and supporting women and people with disability to participate meaningfully in the economy. PSDP is designed to support Timor-Leste&#x2019;s economic transition away from oil dependency to a diversified, resilient economy.</narrative>
  </description>
